meta {
  name: List Branch Radiology Test Options
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/branch-radiology-tests/options?page=1&limit=10
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 10
  ~search: CT
  ~listId: {{branchRadiologyTestListId}}
  ~preferredOnly: true
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Lightweight options for the Create-Order radiology-test picker. Business JWT.
  Returns the active branch's **active default-variant** radiology tests only (one
  orderable row per variant group), so a selected id is directly usable as an
  order item's branch radiology test id. Scoped to the JWT tenant + active branch
  (no `branchId` in the query).

  Query params (all optional):
  - `search` — case-insensitive match against the branch radiology test `testName`.
  - `listId` — which pricing list to load options from. Omitted = the branch's
    Walk-in list.
  - `preferredOnly` — when true AND `search` is empty, narrows results to
    `isPreferenceTest: true` (opt-in; defaults to false).
  - `page` / `limit` — omit `page` for the full array; supply `page` for a
    `{ data, total, page, limit }` envelope.

  400 `ACTIVE_BRANCH_REQUIRED` if the JWT has no active branch.
}
